@startuml
title Validation and class inheritance when adding a student

start
:Parse required student fields and optional guardian / class fields;
if (Field validation succeeds?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Reject input with validation feedback;
  stop
endif
:Check duplicate name ignoring case and repeated spaces;
if (Name conflicts with another student?) then (yes)
  :Reject duplicate;
  stop
endif
if (Scheduled class supplied?) then (yes)
  :Match subject and complete schedule against class catalogue;
  if (A different class overlaps?) then (yes)
    :Reject schedule conflict;
    stop
  endif
  :Inherit omitted details or validate explicit shared details;
  if (Shared details conflict?) then (yes)
    :Reject detail conflict;
    stop
  endif
  :Link to existing class or create class;
  :Create unpaid enrolment with individual agreed rate;
endif
:Add student and preserve existing students' records;
:Return success to LogicManager for persistence;
stop
@enduml
